# Static CBMD error and amplification parameters

This module fixes the coefficient-mass, analytic-error, sample-error, and amplification-window
budgets used by the static algorithm of [WangEtAl2026]. It also derives matrix norm bounds from
exact block encodings and contractivity of dissipative evolution.

## Main statements

* `static_chosen_total_error`: bounds the combined approximation error by `ε * η / 4`.
* `static_chosen_window`: proves positivity and the required lower and upper estimates for the
  amplification window.

## References

* [Wang et al., 2026][WangEtAl2026]
-/

